    {
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "6. How to say 'thank you' in Japanese\n\nOne of the most common ways to say 'thank you' in Japanese is to use the expression Arigatoo. If you want to be a little more polite, you can say Doomo arigatoo (doomo is an intensifier). In a less formal situation, doomo can be used alone as an expression of gratitude."
